      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        419.8437194824219,
        766.47412109375,
        432.4437255859375
      ],
      "text": "These comparisons included studies with a maximum follow-up of 24 months; therefore, TB incidence in the general population was multiplied by a factor of 2 to estimate the number of cases occurring during 24 months.  a",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        431.8437194824219,
        209.2671356201172,
        441.4437255859375
      ],
      "text": "TBI does not apply to the general population. b",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        440.8437194824219,
        786.80126953125,
        450.4437255859375
      ],
      "text": "Ascertainment bias highly likely: TB cases in the general population detected passively, while TB cases in the contacts detected actively. As a result, relative and absolute risks might be overestimated. The composition of the  c",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        66.61409759521484,
        449.8437194824219,
        705.3512573242188,
        459.4437255859375
      ],
      "text": "general and study populations differs (general population of all ages versus a specific age group). TB incidence in the population was estimated by multiplying the yearly notification rate by a factor of 2.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        458.8437194824219,
        402.276611328125,
        468.4437255859375
      ],
      "text": "High heterogeneity between studies probably due to difference in background TB incidence (I  = 84.4%).  d\t 2",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        467.8437194824219,
        144.756591796875,
        477.4437255859375
      ],
      "text": "Few events and wide CI.  e",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        476.8437194824219,
        557.43017578125,
        486.4437255859375
      ],
      "text": "I  = 88.1%, indicating high heterogeneity probably due to difference in background TB prevalence; however, there is a trend across age groups and studies.  f\t 2",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 7.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
